Vrspi Runtime modifies the original work. Changes include a rebranded product
surface, company rooms with seats, mention routing and activation budgets, a
task protocol with a durable journal, workspace visibility controls, and its
own release and update channel. Vrspi is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
supported by the Herdr project, and "Herdr" is used only to identify the work
this fork derives from.

